# Godot skips this whole directory.
#
# art-resources is a staging area, not part of the game — ART_RESOURCES.md calls it
# "copy out only what you use". Without this file Godot imported all ~200MB of it,
# generating 969 .import files and a .godot cache several times the size of the game's
# real assets, and re-scanning it on every editor start.
#
# Nothing loads from here through res://. The build scripts in tools/ read these packs
# from disk with Python, which .gdignore does not affect.
